""

msgid "注: verl框架侧进行采集全量 Profiling 产生海量且重复的算子记录，可以根据文档修改代码仅采集关键阶段"
msgstr "Note: Collecting full Profiling on the verl framework side generates massive and duplicate operator records. You can modify the code according to the documentation to collect only key stages."
